<!doctype html><html><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>PulseReach Dashboard</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/app.css?v=10"></head><body class="app"><aside class="sidebar"><a class="brand" href="/"><span class="brand-mark">♥</span> PulseReach</a><div class="org"><div class="avatar"><%= (organizer.name || "OR").slice(0,2).toUpperCase() %></div><div><b><%= organizer.name %></b><small><%= organizer.organization %></small></div></div><nav class="side-nav"><a class="active" href="/dashboard">⌂ Overview</a><a href="#drives">◷ Drives</a><a href="/participants">♙ Participants</a><a href="/reminders">✦ Reminders</a><a href="/communications">✉ Communications</a><a href="/participants">✓ Attendance</a><a href="/participants">◌ Consent</a><% if (['OWNER','MANAGER'].includes(organizer.role)) { %><a href="/volunteers">♙ Volunteers</a><a href="/audit">◌ Audit</a><% } %></nav><div class="side-bottom"><form method="post" action="/logout"><button class="side-logout">↪ Sign out</button></form><% if (latestDrive) { %><a href="/register/<%= latestDrive._id %>">↗ Registration page</a><% } else { %><a href="/drives/new">＋ Create first drive</a><% } %><span>Prototype v0.2</span></div></aside><main class="main"><header class="page-head"><div><div class="eyebrow">ORGANISER WORKSPACE</div><h1>Good morning, <%= organizer.name.split(" ")[0] %>.</h1><p>Here’s the mobilisation picture for your active drives.</p></div><a class="btn btn-primary" href="/drives/new">＋ Create drive</a></header>
<section class="stats"><div><span>Total registrations</span><strong><%= stats.total %></strong><small>Across active drives</small></div><div><span>Confirmed</span><strong><%= stats.confirmed %></strong><small class="positive">● confirmation rate</small></div><div><span>Predicted attendance</span><strong><%= stats.predicted %></strong><small>AI turnout estimate</small></div><div><span>Actual attendance</span><strong><%= stats.attended %></strong><small>Marked so far</small></div></section>
<section class="panel" id="drives"><div class="panel-head"><div><h2>Active drives</h2><p>Monitor registrations, predicted turnout and progress.</p></div><a href="/drives/new" class="text-link">Create new →</a></div><div class="drive-table"><div class="table-row table-head"><span>Drive</span><span>Date</span><span>Target</span><span>Prediction</span><span>Status</span><span></span></div><% if (!drives.length) { %><div class="empty-state"><b>No drives yet.</b><p>Create your first blood donation drive to start mobilisation.</p></div><% } %><% drives.forEach(d=>{ %><div class="table-row"><div><b><%= d.name %></b><small><%= d.venue %></small></div><span><%= new Date(d.date).toLocaleDateString('en-IN',{day:'2-digit',month:'short',year:'numeric'}) %></span><span><%= d.targetCount %></span><span><b class="score-pill"><%= d.predicted %>%</b><small><%= d.aiPredictionCount || 0 %> AI-updated</small></span><span><em class="status">Active</em></span><a class="row-link" href="/drives/<%= d._id %>">View</a></div><% }) %></div></section>
<section class="panel intelligence-panel"><div class="panel-head"><div><h2>Dashboard intelligence</h2><p>Operational signals showing where mobilisation attention is needed.</p></div><a href="/reminders" class="text-link">Open reminders →</a></div><div class="health intelligence-grid"><div><strong><%= intelligence.projectedFillRate %>%</strong><span>projected target fill</span></div><div><strong><%= intelligence.gapToTarget %></strong><span>people short of target</span></div><div><strong><%= intelligence.atRisk %></strong><span>at-risk participants</span></div><div><strong><%= intelligence.reminderOpportunity %></strong><span>reminder opportunities</span></div><div><strong><%= intelligence.aiCoverage %>%</strong><span>AI prediction coverage</span></div></div><div class="notice"><b>Suggested operational focus</b><p><%= intelligence.reminderOpportunity ? ('There are ' + intelligence.reminderOpportunity + ' consented participants who can receive a personalised reminder.') : 'No immediate reminder opportunity is detected from current participant signals.' %> The system does not make medical eligibility decisions.</p></div></section>
<section class="lower-grid"><div class="panel" id="participants"><div class="panel-head"><div><h2>Recent participants</h2><p>Latest registration activity.</p></div><a href="/participants" class="text-link">View all →</a></div><div class="people"><% if (!participants.length) { %><div class="empty-state"><b>No participants yet.</b><p>Share a drive registration link to start collecting registrations.</p></div><% } %><% participants.slice(0,5).forEach(p=>{ %><div class="person"><div class="avatar soft"><%= p.name[0] %></div><div><b><%= p.name %></b><small><%= p.preferredLanguage %> · <%= p.confirmationStatus %></small></div><span class="confidence"><%= p.predictedAttendance %>%</span></div><% }) %></div></div><div class="panel" id="communication"><div class="panel-head"><div><h2>Communication health</h2><p>Consent-aware mobilisation.</p></div></div><div class="health"><div><strong><%= consentRate %>%</strong><span>current-drive consent</span></div><div><strong><%= confirmedRate %>%</strong><span>confirmation rate</span></div><div><strong><%= engagedRate %>%</strong><span>reminder engagement</span></div></div><div class="notice">✦ <b>AI turnout prediction</b><p>Gemini analyses confirmation, response behaviour, reminder engagement, previous participation and time remaining. Re-run it whenever mobilisation signals change.</p></div></div></section>
<section class="panel" id="attendance"><div class="panel-head"><div><h2>Attendance & consent</h2><p>Operational controls for the day of the drive.</p></div><a class="btn btn-dark" href="/participants">Manage participants</a></div><div class="control-grid"><div><b>Attendance</b><p>Mark actual arrival without collecting medical information.</p></div><div><b>Consent</b><p>Current-drive and future-drive consent stay separate.</p></div><div><b>Audit trail</b><p>Important registration, communication and attendance actions are logged.</p></div></div></section></main><script src="/js/pulsereach-assistant.js?v=1"></script></body></html>
